## XAML Edit Protocol — NON-NEGOTIABLE
Before editing ANY `.xaml` file, two steps are mandatory prerequisites with no exceptions:
1. Run `git branch` — confirm you are NOT on `develop`
2. Invoke `uipath:uipath-rpa` skill — required before the first XAML edit of the session

A hook enforces rule 1 at the tool level (blocks edits on `develop`). Rule 2 is enforced by
this instruction — there is no rationalization that skips it.

