## Library Rules — NON-NEGOTIABLE
- **Never edit files under `Libraries/`** to fix a process-specific bug
- Libraries are shared across all processes — a change there affects every bot
- Fix infrastructure issues (Python PATH, pwsh, etc.) on the VM, not in Library XAML

