## Activity Type Verification — CRITICAL
- Never add an activity type (`ui:SomeActivity`) that does not already exist in the file or project
- Before adding any new activity, verify it exists in the codebase:
  ```powershell
  Select-String -Path ".\**\*.xaml" -Pattern "ui:ActivityName" -Recurse
  ```
- If the activity type is not found: stop and ask before proceeding

