## Git Rules
- Never commit directly to `develop`
- Never skip hooks (`--no-verify`)
- Branch naming: `BT-XXXXX-CarrierName-ProcessType-brief-description`
- Commit message format:
  ```
  [BT-XXXXX] Action: brief description

  - Specific change
  - Another change
  ```
- If VIM opens during merge: `:wq` to save and continue, `:q!` to abort
- Recommended: set Notepad as git editor to avoid VIM: `git config --global core.editor "notepad"`

