## VM Infrastructure

| Component | Location |
|---|---|
| Python 3.11 | `C:\Users\YOUR_USERNAME\AppData\Local\Programs\Python\Python311\python.exe` |
| Python wrapper | `C:\Windows\System32\python.cmd` — must exist for UiPath Robot to find Python |
| PowerShell Core | `C:\Program Files\PowerShell\7\pwsh.exe` — required by TakeFullPageScreenshot |
| Studio cache | `{ProcessFolder}\.local\WorkflowFileValidator.cache` |

**Common issues:**
- Robot can't find Python → check `C:\Windows\System32\python.cmd` exists
- Studio stuck on "Checking for validation errors" → close Studio, delete `WorkflowFileValidator.cache`, reopen
- `TakeFullPageScreenshot` fails → verify `pwsh.exe` is installed at path above

