## Variable & Argument Naming
- Arguments: PascalCase with direction prefix — `in_Gender`, `out_Result`, `io_EmployeeData`
- Variables: camelCase — `genderValue`, `isDropdownOpen`
- Workflow files: PascalCase — `EnterEmployeeInformation.xaml`

## Selector Guidelines
- Use dynamic selectors with arguments where possible: `aaname='{in_EmployeeName}'`
- Prefer `aria-role` attributes over fragile `idx` or absolute `parentid` selectors
- Always validate selectors exist in the target page before committing

