## Pre-PR Checklist
- [ ] Minimum 2-3 transactions tested in Orchestrator
- [ ] Transaction IDs documented in PR description
- [ ] No files under `Libraries/` modified
- [ ] All new activity types verified to exist in project
- [ ] Branch is up to date with develop (`git merge origin/develop --no-edit`)
- [ ] Run `/analyze` before final commit

---

## Pre-Execution Checklist (Orchestrator)
Before triggering a test transaction, confirm:
- [ ] Process package published (Studio publish or confirmed on Orchestrator > Packages)
- [ ] Correct environment selected (Dev/QA — never Prod)
- [ ] Input queue item populated with correct transaction data (Member ID, SSN, action type)
- [ ] Robot is available (not running another job)
- [ ] `python.cmd` exists at `C:\Windows\System32\python.cmd` (if process uses Python)
- [ ] `pwsh.exe` present at `C:\Program Files\PowerShell\7\pwsh.exe` (if uses TakeFullPageScreenshot)
- [ ] Studio closed before triggering (avoids file locks on XAML)
- [ ] Clear any previous failed job output before new run

After execution:
- [ ] Copy Transaction ID from Orchestrator output
- [ ] Confirm target carrier portal reflects the change
- [ ] Document result in PR description table

